VIA1.S.11:Array1_2_3_4_5_6_M {@Minimum space between two VIAs in 6-level continuous stacking VIA arrays with below condition. >=0.49um
    @ Via1 violate 0.49 spacing in Via1/Via2/Via3/Via4/Via5/ViaD array & density large or equal 0.1
  A1 = NET AREA RATIO VIA1_Violate_S_6_A1 VIA1_6stack.Final >= VIA_D_1
  A2 = NET AREA RATIO VIA2_Violate_S_6_A1 VIA1_6stack.Final >= VIA_D_1
  A3 = NET AREA RATIO VIA3_Violate_S_6_A1 VIA1_6stack.Final >= VIA_D_1
  A4 = NET AREA RATIO VIA4_Violate_S_6_A1 VIA1_6stack.Final >= VIA_D_1
